<TXSPN>"I'm hooome."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Welcome back, </STYLE>Momoko<STYLE ID="1">. Was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> a good girl?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yep, as you can see."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mommy, I'm home!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, welcome back! How were the flowers?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Guess what, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a person, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">went whooosh, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and fell down!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A person fell...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>! Let's hurry up and have a snack!
{PAUSE ""}
　You said you wanted ice cream, didn't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yaaay! Ice creeeam!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s down for a nap."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong, </STYLE>Momoko<STYLE ID="1">? You seem down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You haven't touched your ice cream at all, either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE> said it, didn't she? That a person fell."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Was somebody climbing a tree or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sorry, Mom, I'm going to bed too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's still the middle of the day, you know?"</STYLE><PG>
"I'm feeling a little sick..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you okay? Do you have a fever? Should I make you some rice porridge?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, I'm just a little sleepy."
